# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Showwork tree snapshots are one-line hash maps (~70KB+ each). Leaving them
# in the patch fills the Claude review 200k cap before SDK code is visible.
# Keep LF text on disk; do not emit the JSON body in `git diff` / `gh pr diff`.
# Existing snapshot bytes stay unchanged so recorded hashes remain verifiable.
.showwork/snapshots/*.json text eol=lf -diff
